  <entity00145109:AccountingProceduresForTechnologyTransferAgreementOfDisclosureOfTechnologyTransferContractsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfTechnologyTransferContractsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_entity00145109_TypesOfTechnologyTransferContractsAxisOfDisclosureOfTechnologyTransferContractsOfAxis_entity00145109_TechnologyTransferAgreementForTargetedAntiCancerTreatmentForNonSmallCellLungCancerMemberOfTechnologyTransferContractsMemberOfDisclosureOfTechnologyTransferContractsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">계약금은 수행의무 이행 기간 동안 진행기준에 따라 수익으로 인식하고, 수령한 로열티와 마일스톤은 한 시점에 수익으로 인식하였습니다. 한편, 원천기술 개발사인 ㈜오스코텍과 Genosco Inc.에 지급하는 수수료는 비용처리하고 있습니다.</entity00145109:AccountingProceduresForTechnologyTransferAgreementOfDisclosureOfTechnologyTransferContractsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfTechnologyTransferContractsTableOfItems>
  <entity00145109:AccountingProceduresForTechnologyTransferAgreementOfDisclosureOfTechnologyTransferContractsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfTechnologyTransferContractsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_entity00145109_TypesOfTechnologyTransferContractsAxisOfDisclosureOfTechnologyTransferContractsOfAxis_entity00145109_TechnologyTransferAgreementForTreatmentsOfDegenerativeDiscDiseaseMemberOfTechnologyTransferContractsMemberOfDisclosureOfTechnologyTransferContractsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">계약금 및 수령한 마일스톤은 일시에 수익인식하였습니다.</entity00145109:AccountingProceduresForTechnologyTransferAgreementOfDisclosureOfTechnologyTransferContractsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfTechnologyTransferContractsTableOfItems>
